node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.approval/*.sqlite

# The verified-head snapshot (APRV-188): the daemon's endorsement of the log
# bytes it just walked, so the next hook process re-proves a digest instead of
# re-walking the chain. Local, derived, and re-proved by every reader — never
# evidence, and never something a clone should inherit.
.approval/log/verified-head.json
.approval/log/verified-head.json.*.tmp

# The encrypted credential vault (SPEC.md §10.4). Never committed, in any
# repository: the contents stay encrypted, but a published vault is a permanent
# offline-attack target against one human-chosen passphrase, and a commit is not
# something a later commit removes. `approval doctor` fails when this line is
# missing.
.approval/vault.enc
.claude/settings.local.json

# Private strategy notes: never committed, never published (Pages serves repo root)
private/*
!private/README.md

# The ungated agent journal (APRV-195): local signal for the operator, not
# truth and not evidence. The log is the record that gets committed.
.approval-journal/

# The live-draw socket (APRV-208): the daemon answers supervised-live draws for
# hook processes that hold no sampling secret. Owner-only, derived, and gone the
# moment the daemon stops. A socket is not a file a clone can inherit.
.approval/daemon/
